      "text": "```\nBAYEUX TAPESTRY (c. 1077)\n  Embroidered linen, ~70 meters long\n  Sequential narrative: 1066 Norman Conquest of England\n  Left to right reading direction; Latin captions\n  Continuous narrative (not panel-separated)\n  Not a comic: no clear panel divisions, no gutter\n  BUT: sequential visual narrative; text + image; read in order"
    },
