        "section": "comics-sequential-art",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "History of Comics as a Form",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "IMPORTANCE: the \"Yellow Kid Wars\" between Pulitzer and Hearst\n  showed that popular characters could sell newspapers.\n  The economics of comics = newspaper circulation weapon.\n  This never changed: media uses comics as reader-magnets.\n```"
    },
