      "text": "```\nACTION COMICS #1 (Jerry Siegel / Joe Shuster, June 1938)\n  Superman: first superhero as understood by the genre\n  Origin: mild-mannered reporter; disguise; super-powers; fights crime\n  Costume: visual distinction from civilian identity\n  Jewish immigrant creators; fantasy of strength against oppression\n  Historical reading: created while Hitler rose; wish-fulfillment"
    },
