      "text": "WORLD WAR II COMICS\n  Captain America #1 (1941): punches Hitler on cover\n  Comics: central wartime entertainment medium\n  Sold millions of copies\n  Military: distributed to troops (cheap, portable)\n  Post-war: market collapses; genres diversify (horror, crime, Western)\n```"
