      "text": "```\nFREDRIC WERTHAM'S \"SEDUCTION OF THE INNOCENT\" (1954)\n  Psychiatrist; argued comics caused juvenile delinquency\n  Batman and Robin: \"homosexual fantasy\"\n  Wonder Woman: lesbian subtext; sadism\n  Horror comics (EC Comics, William Gaines): caused violence\n  Evidence: cherry-picked; methodology later discredited\n  But: created a moral panic"
