      "text": "COMICS CODE AUTHORITY (CCA, October 1954)\n  Self-regulatory body; created by publishers to avoid legislation\n  Rules: no crime \"pay off\"; no disrespect for authority;\n         no \"walking dead\" / vampires / werewolves in titles;\n         marriage respected; no sexual deviation;\n         drugs shown only negatively"
